# Requirements: text, basis, acceptance check, official context source ids, origin, legacy mapping.
R=[]
def req(i,cat,text,basis,check,ids,origin='Proposed control',legacy=''):
 ids=ids.split() if isinstance(ids,str) else ids
 R.append(dict(id=i,category=cat,requirement=text,basis=basis,acceptance_check=check,source_ids=ids,origin=origin,status='Open — confirm in writing' if origin!='Official rule' else 'Official source reviewed; job applicability to confirm',legacy_ids=legacy,official_url=by[ids[0]]['url']))
req('R-01','Problem & outcome','Free or replace the stuck bathtub waste-and-overflow trip lever without destroying the concealed plumbing.','Owner problem statement; manufacturer instructions describe the assembly but do not identify this unit.','Provider documents the existing brand/model, what moved, what remained stuck and the chosen repair path.',['OWNER','WATCO'],'Owner requirement','root R-01/R-03; bt R-S01/R-S03; data REQ-01/03')
req('R-02','Problem & outcome','Restore a stopper that seals when closed and a drain that runs freely when open.','Functional acceptance control; Watco instructions include a fill/operate test for its models.','Fill, close, open and leak-test; record results before closing any opening.',['WATCO','OWNER'],'Proposed control','data REQ-02')
req('R-03','Problem & outcome','Obtain photographs of the tub, overflow plate, access area and ceiling below before finalizing scope.','No photographs were supplied in the repository; description-based analysis is limited.','Before/during/after images are retained with the job record.',['OWNER','CSLB-CONTRACT'],'Owner requirement','root R-04/R-25; bt R-S05; data REQ-24/27')
req('R-04','Problem & outcome','Identify the actual waste-and-overflow brand/model, drain size and whether a compatible kit exists.','Existing assembly is unknown; model-specific instructions cannot be assumed to fit.','Provider records model/size and compatibility before ordering parts.',['WATCO','OWNER'],'Proposed control','bt R-A04')
req('R-05','Access','Prefer removal from above through the overflow opening if it can be done safely without damaging concealed piping.','Owner preference; Watco shows a tub-side service path for its models.','Provider attempts/documents the non-destructive route before cutting finished surfaces.',['OWNER','WATCO'],'Owner requirement','root R-05; data REQ-04/06')
req('R-06','Access','Use below-ceiling access through the storage unit only if the above route fails or is judged unsafe.','Owner-reported fallback; Heise’s publishes an adjacent ceiling-access case.','Written access decision names the opening location, size and restoration plan.',['OWNER','HEISE-INGLESIDE'],'Owner requirement','root R-06/R-07; bt R-A01; data REQ-05')
req('R-07','Access','Confirm ownership, authority and consent to enter/open the storage unit or separate space below.','Access may involve a different tenant, owner or common area.','Written authorization and affected-party notice are in the job file.',['CIV-1954','OWNER'],'Proposed control','bt R-A02/R-A03; data REQ-16')
req('R-08','Access','Consider a code-compliant serviceable access panel rather than burying slip-joint connections again.','Access-panel dimensions could not be verified from a free official code source; do not assert a fixed 12-inch rule.','Contractor/DBI specifies the required access solution and dimensions in writing.',['SF-PERMIT','IAPMO','WATCO'],'Proposed control','root R-08; bt R-S04')
req('R-09','Scope & restoration','Adjust the linkage first if serviceable; replace the waste-and-overflow assembly if it cannot be freed.','Owner estimates describe different scopes; manufacturer instructions are model-specific.','Written scope distinguishes adjustment, linkage replacement and full assembly replacement.',['OWNER','WATCO'],'Owner requirement','root R-09/R-10; bt R-S01')
req('R-10','Scope & restoration','Clarify whether “spout/diverter” means the tub waste-and-overflow or a separate tub-fill diverter.','Bay Area Plumbing wording is not automatically equivalent to waste-and-overflow replacement.','Annotated scope identifies each part to be repaired/replaced.',['OWNER','CSLB-C36'],'Proposed control','root R-10; bt R-S02')
req('R-11','Scope & restoration','Protect existing concealed supply, waste and vent piping; price any unavoidable cutting/replacement separately.','Owner preservation requirement; DBI permit rule applies to cutting/replacing pipes.','Change order identifies affected piping, permit/inspection path and price before extra work.',['OWNER','SF-PERMIT','CSLB-CONTRACT'],'Owner requirement','bt R-S03')
req('R-12','Scope & restoration','Restore drywall, tape, texture and paint to an agreed finish after any ceiling opening.','C-9 defines drywall/finishing scope; no supplied quote explicitly names restoration.','Contract names the restoration party, finish standard and access-panel/patch choice.',['CSLB-C9','OWNER'],'Owner requirement','root R-08/R-12; bt R-S04; data REQ-07')
req('R-13','Scope & restoration','Protect floors/fixtures and stored contents, contain dust, remove debris and leave the space clean/secure each day.','Occupied-unit control; CSLB contract guidance includes cleanup.','Daily cleanup/protection checklist and final walkthrough are agreed.',['CSLB-CONTRACT','OWNER'],'Proposed control','bt R-T04; data REQ-15')
req('R-14','Provider & licensing','Use a currently licensed plumbing contractor for the plumbing leg and verify the legal contracting entity.','C-36 defines plumbing scope; CSLB records are point-in-time.','CSLB number, legal name, status and classifications match the contract on signing day.',['CSLB-C36','BPC-7048','CSLB-SEARCH'],'Owner requirement','root R-13/R-14; bt R-L01/R-L05; data REQ-08/09')
req('R-15','Provider & licensing','Structure the combined contract lawfully: B prime with appropriate trades, or named licensed specialty subcontractors.','BPC §7057 and CSLB C-9/C-36 definitions; B-2 has separate limits.','Contract names who performs plumbing and who performs drywall/restoration, with license numbers.',['BPC-7057','CSLB-B-FAST','CSLB-C9','CSLB-C36','BPC-7057-5'],'Official rule','root R-12/R-17; bt R-L02; data REQ-07')
req('R-16','Provider & licensing','Recheck license status, bond, workers-compensation record and complaint-disclosure links before signing.','CSLB warns status can change and disclosure is limited; one checked license is suspended.','Signing-day CSLB screenshot/link and any disclosure review are retained.',['CSLB-SEARCH','CSLB-1027286','DG-COMPLAINT'],'Proposed control','root R-14; bt R-L05/R-V04; data REQ-09')
req('R-17','Provider & licensing','Obtain current general-liability evidence and workers-compensation evidence for every onsite party.','CSLB workers-comp “exempt” means certified no employees, not general liability coverage.','Certificates name the contracting entity and cover the work date; subcontractors are included.',['CSLB-1115649','CSLB-CONTRACT'],'Proposed control','root R-15; bt R-L06/R-V03')
req('R-18','Provider & licensing','Confirm the provider actually serves the San Francisco address and accepts a small occupied-unit repair.','Registered city is not a service-area guarantee; several sites emphasize larger/commercial work.','Written service-area and job-acceptance confirmation.',['CSLB-1106131','WEDO','AYOOB','OWNER'],'Owner requirement','root R-16; bt R-V05; data REQ-10')
req('R-19','Provider & licensing','Ask for specific waste-and-overflow/trip-lever references, ideally below-ceiling access in an occupied unit.','Heise’s has adjacent self-published cases; no provider confirms this exact job.','References/photos identify the actual scope, access route and restoration party.',['HEISE-INGLESIDE','HEISE-MISSION','OWNER'],'Owner requirement','bt R-V01; data REQ-11')
req('R-20','Provider & licensing','Check third-party reviews, but treat blocked/search-index observations as unverified leads.','Yelp business pages returned 403; numeric ratings/counts were not verified.','Review links and retrieval limits are recorded; no rating is presented as verified.',['YELP-RF','YELP-ACE','CSLB-SEARCH'],'Owner requirement','data REQ-12')
req('R-21','Provider & licensing','Prefer a provider that states it coordinates with landlords/property managers and occupied properties.','Company self-descriptions and older review excerpts are leads, not current protocols.','Provider supplies a written occupied-unit plan and tenant contact protocol.',['ACE','HEISE-MAINT','YELP-ACE','OWNER'],'Owner requirement','bt R-V02; data REQ-11/13')
req('R-22','Permit & code','Obtain a written DBI/contractor permit determination for the exact scope before work starts.','SF.gov requires a permit before cutting/replacing pipes; §104.2 exemptions are conditional.','Determination states whether a permit is required, which permit, who pulls it and inspection steps.',['SF-PERMIT','SF-CODE-104','SF-DBI'],'Official rule','root R-18; bt R-P01; data REQ-17')
req('R-23','Permit & code','Do not treat leak/unstopping/faucet exemptions as covering cutting into or removing piping/traps.','SF Plumbing Code §104.2 text was directly retrieved.','Scope is matched against the exact exemption conditions; cutting/replacement is not assumed exempt.',['SF-CODE-104','SF-PERMIT'],'Official rule','bt R-P01; root code C-02 correction')
req('R-24','Permit & code','If a permit is required, use the appropriate licensed contractor and PermitSF route.','DBI lists eligible classes and registration/AUTH process; owner-self-work is limited.','Permit holder, license class and AUTH/registration status are confirmed.',['SF-PERMIT','SF-AUTH','SF-REMODEL'],'Official rule','bt R-P02; data REQ-19/20')
req('R-25','Permit & code','Schedule required plumbing inspection before pipes or openings are covered.','SF.gov states inspection before covering; remodel finals wait for trade finals.','Inspection sign-off is retained before restoration closes the cavity.',['SF-PERMIT','SF-REMODEL'],'Official rule','root R-20; bt R-P02; data REQ-18')
req('R-26','Permit & code','Budget official DBI fees separately and confirm the job category; do not present a fee as the total repair price.','July 2026 Table 1A-C lists Category 1P $290 and other rates; category is unconfirmed.','Quote lists permit/inspection fees separately or states they are excluded.',['SF-FEES','SF-CODE-104'],'Proposed control','root R-19; bt R-P03/R-B03')
req('R-27','Permit & code','Confirm the adopted code edition and any access-panel requirement with DBI/contractor; leave unverified dimensions blank.','IAPMO operative text was members-only; SF code amendments URL returned 404.','Written code/access requirement is supplied; no inferred 12-inch rule is published as verified.',['SF-CODE-104','IAPMO','SF-DBI'],'Proposed control','bt R-P04/R-P05; root code C-15 correction')
req('R-28','Tenant & occupancy','Give affected tenants reasonable written notice with date, approximate time and purpose; 24 hours is presumed reasonable.','Civil Code §1954; mailed notice is presumed reasonable at six days.','Notice copies and delivery method are retained for each affected tenancy.',['CIV-1954'],'Official rule','root R-21; bt R-T01; data REQ-14')
req('R-29','Tenant & occupancy','Enter during normal business hours unless an exception or tenant consent applies.','Civil Code §1954 lists emergency, consent and other exceptions.','Work window and any consent are documented.',['CIV-1954'],'Official rule','root R-22; bt R-T01/T02; data REQ-14')
req('R-30','Tenant & occupancy','Coordinate water shut-off, bathroom usability and any alternative arrangements with affected occupants.','Occupied-unit control; no provider has confirmed a work window.','Written schedule identifies shut-off duration, usable facilities and contacts.',['OWNER','CIV-1954','ACE'],'Proposed control','bt R-T03; data REQ-13/15')
req('R-31','Tenant & occupancy','Screen for lead-paint rules before disturbing paint in a pre-1978 rental; building age is unknown.','EPA RRP applies conditionally to paid paint-disturbing work in pre-1978 rentals.','Age/paint assessment and certified-firm/lead-safe plan are documented if applicable.',['EPA-RRP','EPA-RRP-RULES'],'Official rule','new conditional control')
req('R-32','Tenant & occupancy','Do not disturb suspect asbestos-containing material; use a trained/accredited professional if sampling or disturbance is possible.','EPA guidance; building materials/age are unknown.','Suspect material is left alone until assessed; any abatement party is properly qualified.',['EPA-ASBESTOS','CSLB-B-FAST'],'Proposed control','bt R-A05')
req('R-33','Commercial & evidence','Obtain a written itemized contract covering plumbing, access, restoration, permits, cleanup, schedule, price and warranty.','CSLB requires a written contract over $500 and lists essential terms.','Signed contract includes all trades, exclusions, warranty and change-order process.',['CSLB-CONTRACT','OWNER'],'Owner requirement','root R-26; bt R-L03; data REQ-21')
req('R-34','Commercial & evidence','Limit the down payment to the lesser of 10% or $1,000 unless a statutory exception applies.','CSLB contract guidance; rare blanket-bond exception exists.','Payment schedule matches the rule and written contract.',['CSLB-CONTRACT'],'Official rule','bt R-L04')
req('R-35','Commercial & evidence','Use written change orders for concealed damage or scope changes before extra work proceeds.','CSLB contract guidance; concealed conditions are unknown.','Change order states scope, price, permit/inspection impact and schedule.',['CSLB-CONTRACT','SF-PERMIT'],'Proposed control','bt R-L03; data REQ-21')
req('R-36','Commercial & evidence','Requote one identical scope across at least three providers, including a combined-scope option.','The three supplied estimates cover different work and are not a comparable price range.','Comparable bids use the same parts, access path, restoration, permit and cleanup assumptions.',['OWNER','CSLB-CONTRACT'],'Owner requirement','root R-11/R-27/R-28; bt R-B01/B02; data REQ-22')
req('R-37','Commercial & evidence','Confirm the 2026-08-30 estimates are still valid and obtain a current combined plumbing-plus-restoration price.','Quote validity and ceiling-restoration pricing were not supplied.','Current written validity date and combined fallback price are recorded.',['OWNER','CSLB-CONTRACT'],'Owner requirement','data REQ-23; root R-28')
req('R-38','Commercial & evidence','Set an owner approval ceiling that includes permit fees, restoration allowance and concealed-condition contingency.','No total project budget or drywall allowance was supplied.','Approval ceiling and allowance assumptions are written before authorization.',['OWNER','SF-FEES','CSLB-CONTRACT'],'Proposed control','bt R-B03')
req('R-39','Commercial & evidence','Fix the work window and tenant availability before contracting; do not claim a provider is booked.','No provider acceptance, appointment or availability was confirmed.','Written schedule and tenant coordination are retained.',['OWNER','CIV-1954'],'Owner requirement','bt R-B04; root R-26')
req('R-40','Commercial & evidence','Leak-test and function-test before closing the ceiling; retain inspection and test records.','Watco model instructions include fill/operate testing; DBI requires inspection before covering.','Test/inspection results and photos are accepted before final restoration.',['WATCO','SF-PERMIT'],'Proposed control','root R-24/R-25; data REQ-02/24')
req('R-41','Commercial & evidence','Keep a small, comparable call list with one stated scope so providers are not quoting blind.','Research produced leads, not confirmed bids or bookings.','Each inquiry uses the same neutral scope sheet and records the response.',['OWNER','CSLB-CONTRACT'],'Proposed control','bt R-V05')
req('R-42','Publication & audit','Publish every factual table row with its source link and retrieval status; leave unconfirmable values blank and flagged.','Owner verification instruction; repository audit trail.','Automated row-source, blank-field and link checks pass before publication.',['REPO','OWNER'],'Owner requirement','root R-29; data REQ-26')
